WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.049
Tina: What if we just put the magic clay on the flower?

2
00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:08.916
Brad: I guess we could try that.

3
00:00:08.917 --> 00:00:11.072
Danny: That didn’t work.

4
00:00:11.073 --> 00:00:13.472
Tina: The clay is too heavy.

5
00:00:13.473 --> 00:00:16.519
Brad: Maybe if the clay was smaller . . .

6
00:00:16.520 --> 00:00:20.486
Danny: I’ve got an idea!

7
00:00:20.487 --> 00:00:22.302
Tina: What’s that?

8
00:00:22.303 --> 00:00:24.343
Danny: A pepper shaker!

9
00:00:24.344 --> 00:00:33.553
With it, I can sprinkle red powder.

10
00:00:33.555 --> 00:00:34.907
Tina: Look!

11
00:00:34.908 --> 00:00:39.364
Danny: My imagination saves the day again!

12
00:00:39.366 --> 00:00:43.706
Brad: Yes, but how can we sprinkle powder on every flower?

13
00:00:43.707 --> 00:00:55.942
Tina: Yeah, that would take forever.

14
00:00:55.943 --> 00:00:57.970
What is that? Brad:

15
00:00:57.971 --> 00:01:00.599
It’s a huge dragonfly! Danny:

16
00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:06.119
It’s coming right at us. Brad:

17
00:01:06.120 --> 00:01:09.319
Duck! Tina:

18
00:01:09.320 --> 00:01:12.973
Bello, lie down! Bello:

19
00:01:12.974 --> 00:01:14.345
Nap time? Tina:

20
00:01:14.346 --> 00:01:17.218
That’s right, it’s nap time. Danny:

21
00:01:17.219 --> 00:01:20.272
Do you think it’s gone? Brad:

22
00:01:20.273 --> 00:01:26.048
No! Stay down! Danny:

23
00:01:26.049 --> 00:01:29.440
Oh no! Did you see what it did?

24
00:01:29.441 --> 00:01:31.884
Tina: It ate the red flower.

25
00:01:31.885 --> 00:01:34.370
Brad: What are we going to do now?

26
00:01:34.371 --> 00:01:37.962
Danny: We’ve got to squash that evil insect!

27
00:01:37.963 --> 00:01:39.724
Tina: But how?

28
00:01:39.725 --> 00:01:43.535
Danny: There’s got to be a way.

29
00:01:43.536 --> 00:01:52.564
Brad: It’s coming back. Hide!

30
00:01:52.565 --> 00:01:54.050
Bello: Tree!

31
00:01:54.051 --> 00:01:56.894
Tina: We should be safe here.

32
00:01:56.895 --> 00:02:00.971
Brad: What’s it doing?

33
00:02:00.972 --> 00:02:03.274
Danny: It spit its fangs!

34
00:02:03.275 --> 00:02:07.935
Tina: They’re coming right at us!

35
00:02:07.936 --> 00:02:10.064
Brad: We’re doomed!

36
00:02:10.065 --> 00:02:13.087
Danny: Quick, dive into the stream!

37
00:02:13.088 --> 00:02:14.254
Tina: What?

38
00:02:14.256 --> 00:02:25.446
Danny: Dive into the stream and hold your breath!

39
00:02:25.447 --> 00:02:28.976
Brad: You forgot to warn us to take a deep breath!

40
00:02:28.977 --> 00:02:30.551
Danny: It’s okay now.

41
00:02:30.552 --> 00:02:32.287
I think it’s gone.

42
00:02:32.288 --> 00:02:34.675
Tina: Bello, you’ll get dirty.

43
00:02:34.676 --> 00:02:36.351
It’s too muddy.

44
00:02:36.353 --> 00:02:38.389
Bello: Mud.

45
00:02:38.390 --> 00:02:41.080
Brad: Do you hear what I hear?

46
00:02:41.081 --> 00:02:43.841
Danny: Where is it?

47
00:02:43.842 --> 00:02:47.429
Tina: There it is!

48
00:02:47.430 --> 00:02:51.054
All three: Ahhhhhh!

